|desc=
When you hit with a melee or arrow attack, there is a {{ctl|65%|30|50%}} chance that a warden will appear from another timeline to attack a random enemy.

The summoned warden will attempt a melee attack if you made an arrow attack, or an arrow attack if you made a melee attack.

These wardens are out of phase with your reality and deal (100% - {{ctl|95%|60|80%}}) less damage, and their arrows will pass through friendly targets.

A warden can only be summoned this way once per turn and they return to their own timeline after attacking.
